# Read by every "dotnet build" and "dotnet test" started in this tree.
#
# The PKI embeds a web interface that npm and webpack build. Nothing here
# looks at it, and neither node nor npm is on a CI runner. As a global
# property this reaches every project of the build alike; set per
# ProjectReference (AdditionalProperties) it would reach the PKI and,
# inherited, Hermod and the rest as well - built twice then, once with it
# and once without, into the same obj/.
#
# Not a Directory.Build.props: the PKI, Norn, Urdr and WWCP_* do not import
# one from above, and Hermod and Styx would take everything else it said too.
-p:SkipFrontendBuild=true
